        {
          "text": "“Aba huuydeanda giliwas gweaydeaba samwagu gajadayda gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea gida inyasi aba jeeda gweaydida, ak giimughuushi aba jeesingeaba gheang'u. ",
