              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara siida dooshta Lawi aba gideaba manda gichea gwahearan aba headaang'u, ea rabascheanda, ea bananeeda, ea masinung'weanda mida jeeda mujiinajeagaagu, gayghapka gweagiischi ea gwalang'u; ak abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygabadiischeesa gadiyoojiga iisini aba geatingaagu.",
